Our technology platform enables the capture of high-resolution still images and HD video while simultaneously encoding HD video for high-quality
storage and lower resolution video for Internet sharing and wireless networking. Multi stream video capture enhances the consumer experience by offering
the ability to instantaneously share captured video without having to go through a transcoding process. Our computer stereo vision processing solutions
provide the ability to detect generic objects without training, allowing more robust decisions to be made in applications such as autonomous driving.
